{"title": "Unbeating Heart (Condition)", "pageid": 13442, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Unbeating_Heart_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status properties", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Unbeating Heart Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Unbeating Heart</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Carrion's undying life force is stored outside of his body - if killed while his heart is intact, he will rise again the next day. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/ApplyToDead\" title=\"Status properties/ApplyToDead\">ApplyToDead</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Clues to the location of <a href=\"/wiki/Mystic_Carrion\" title=\"Mystic Carrion\">Mystic Carrion's</a> heart is found in the book <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Funerary_Jar_Form_and_Function\" title=\"Funerary Jar Form and Function\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/eb/DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/eb/DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/eb/DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/eb/DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/eb/DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_A_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Funerary_Jar_Form_and_Function\" title=\"Funerary Jar Form and Function\">Funerary Jar Form and Function</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creatures_with_Unbeating_Heart\">Creatures with Unbeating Heart</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mystic_Carrion\" title=\"Mystic Carrion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png/30px-Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png/45px-Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png/60px-Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mystic Carrion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png/30px-Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mystic_Carrion\" title=\"Mystic Carrion\">Mystic Carrion</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Carrion cannot be killed while his heart is intact.</div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714210054\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.047 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1451/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 16672/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6132/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.022/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1063908/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   45.215      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   45.215      1 -total\n 58.34%   26.380      3 Template:Hidden_code\n 32.77%   14.815      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 15.94%    7.208      1 Template:Condition_sources/format\n 14.81%    6